chx:CQs a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestionSet ; rdfs:label "Chapter 16 competency questions"@en ; rd:containsCompetencyQuestion chx:CQ1, chx:CQ2 .
chx:CQ1 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which statements change the database, which only read it, and what decides whether a change is kept, undone or refused?"@en .
chx:CQ2 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which printed outputs, programs, numbers and statements of the chapter differ in current Python, in current SQLite, in the files the book ships or in the pages it points to, and on what source?"@en .
